{"t": 1794781351402, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "winter_unreachable", "Pacing/perf: after 16 real minutes the game is only at tick 127664 (day 4, 0.555, Autumn day 1/2). The sim runs at 5-12 tps (status: tps 5.9-10.7, fps 1-2) instead of 50. Winter warning is only due on the last day before winter (tick 150000) and winter starts at tick 180000; at ~8 tps that is ~47 min and ~110 min of wall-clock away, so the first winter cannot be reached in a 35-minute session. No in-game way to pass time (no sleep/wait) found."]}
